{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Marie,\n\nI am writing from Kassel, where I arrived last evening. The heat here is oppressive, though the air is cleaner than in Berlin. I must tell you that I was received with a great deal of courtesy at the inn, but I found it impossible to accept the hospitality of the Conrector Matthias’s house. His son, a young man of some promise, came to me personally with the invitation. I declined politely, but firmly. I am a man of habit, Marie, and I find that I require the solitude of an inn room to settle after the journey. The house was too full of life for my present disposition.\n\nThe rest of the day has been spent in quiet reflection. I walked briefly in the park, though the sun was still high. I have taken a little wine and am now resting. I do not intend to remain long; the road calls me forward.\n\nYour loving\nG."}}],"created":1795220931,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":190,"prompt_tokens":979,"total_tokens":1169,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-F6VQWISKElwIFDnJwJ9kf15N9IwBO7xf","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":979,"prompt_ms":1061.863,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0846404494382023,"prompt_per_second":921.9645095459583,"predicted_n":190,"predicted_ms":4507.624,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.849862433862434,"predicted_per_second":41.92896301909831}}